1
00:00:00,037 --> 00:00:03,957
(Sheldon:)I no longer stage spontaneous
biohazard drills after 10 p.m.

2
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:07,505
(Sheldon:)And I abandoned my goal
to master Tuvan throat singing.

3
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:09,755
-I shouldn't ask, but what is--?
-No.

4
00:00:09,922 --> 00:00:11,922
[VOCALIZING]

5
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:21,769
(Sheldon(after demonstrating):)I'd be much further along
if I'd been allowed to practice.

6
00:00:22,393 --> 00:00:24,983
(Leonard:)Look, Sheldon,
I know it's in the agreement.

7
00:00:25,146 --> 00:00:27,936
(Leonard:)If you turn into a zombie,
I promise I will not kill you.

8
00:00:28,107 --> 00:00:32,277
(Leonard:)In fact, I'll even let you eat my brains.
But I'm taking Penny to Switzerland.

9
00:00:32,653 --> 00:00:34,783
(Sheldon:)-Is that your final decision?
-It is.

10
00:00:34,947 --> 00:00:36,827
(Sheldon:)Very well.

11
00:00:39,577 --> 00:00:40,787
(Penny:)It's not over, is it?

12
00:00:41,621 --> 00:00:42,911
(Leonard:)What do you think?

13
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,670
[SHELDON VOCALIZING]

14
00:00:56,636 --> 00:01:03,026
(Leonard:)Got a bit of traffic this morning, huh?

